#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:18976
msgid ""
"Format a description for something like a variable in a typed language---an "
"entity that records a value.  Takes as arguments the category of entity "
"being described, the type, and the name of the entity.  @xref{Definition "
"Commands}."
msgstr ""

