"Pair with @code{@@end example}.  @code{@@example} accepts optional "
"arguments, separated by commas.  It is recommended to set the first argument "
"to the language of the example code.  @xref{@code{@@example}}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19107
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@exampleindent @var{indent}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19110
msgid ""
"Indent example-like environments by @var{indent} number of spaces (perhaps "
"0).  @xref{@code{@@exampleindent}}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19111
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@exclamdown@{@}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19113
msgid "Generate an upside-down exclamation point.  @xref{Inserting Accents}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19114
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@exdent @var{line-of-text}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19116
msgid "Remove any indentation a line might have.  @xref{@code{@@exdent}}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19117
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@expansion@{@}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19120
msgid ""
"Indicate the result of a macro expansion to the reader with a special glyph: "
"@samp{@expansion{}}.  @xref{@code{@@expansion}}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19121
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@file@{@var{filename}@}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19124
msgid ""
"Highlight the name of a file, buffer, node, directory, etc.  "
"@xref{@code{@@file}}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19125
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@finalout"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19128
msgid ""
"Prevent @TeX{} from printing large black warning rectangles beside over-wide "
"lines.  @xref{Overfull hboxes}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19129
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@findex @var{entry}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19132
msgid ""
"Add @var{entry} to the index of functions.  @xref{Index Entries, , Defining "
"the Entries of an Index}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19133
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@firstparagraphindent @var{word}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19137
msgid ""
"Control indentation of the first paragraph after section headers according "
"to @var{word}, one of `none' or `insert'.  "
"@xref{@code{@@firstparagraphindent}}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19138
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@float"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19141
msgid ""
"Environment to define floating material.  Pair with @code{@@end float}.  "
"@xref{Floats}."
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19148
msgid ""
"Do not fill text; left (right) justify every line while leaving the right "
"(left) end ragged.  Leave font as is.  Pair with @code{@@end flushleft} "
"(@code{@@end flushright}).  @xref{@code{@@flushleft @@flushright}}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19149
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@fonttextsize @var{10-11}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19152
msgid ""
"Change the size of the main body font in the printed output.  @xref{Fonts}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19153
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@footnote@{@var{text-of-footnote}@}"
msgstr ""

#. type: table
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19159
