"text.  Footnote text is printed at the bottom of the page in printed "
"output.  In other formats, footnote text can be output in the same node, in "
"a separate node, or simply be marked as being footnote text.  "
"@xref{Footnotes}."
msgstr ""

#. type: item
#: texinfo/texinfo.texi:19160
#, no-wrap
msgid "@@footnotestyle @var{style}"
